OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping CCTV cameras to be
OL,4,Adeployed in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new network of CCTV cameras will be
OL,7,Fdeployed across sites linked to
OL,8,Ffly-tipping in Derby following a
OL,9,Fsuccessful trial.
OL,11,FA camera was set up by Derby City
OL,12,FCouncil at the beginning of August in
OL,13,FCharlotte Street, where rubbish had
OL,14,Fbeen dumped on a number of occasions.
OL,16,FSix offenders have since been
OL,17,Fidentified and each handed a #600 fine
OL,18,Ffor illegally dumping domestic waste.
OL,20,FNow, the council is investing in a
OL,21,Ffurther 14 cameras to catch culprits of
OL,22,Fenvironmental crime in the city.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
